{
  "name": "Security Questionnaire Auto-Drafter",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📋 SECURITY QUESTIONNAIRE AUTO-DRAFTER\n**What it does:** Reads vendor security questionnaire questions from Google Sheets → logs each with status `NEW` → an AI Agent drafts an answer strictly from YOUR approved policy doc (never invents certifications) → confidence gate: high-confidence answers flip to `APPROVED`, low-confidence ones flip to `IN_REVIEW` and ping a human on Telegram.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets + Google Docs OAuth2 credentials\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `DRAFTED` → `APPROVED` (low-confidence answers go `DRAFTED` → `IN_REVIEW`)",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 5300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "fcc22d97-409d-46c1-b39d-45848199d4cf",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Trigger + config + read questions\nManual trigger → CONFIG — Inputs (all editable values) → Read Questions pulls rows from the Questions tab (headers: `Question #`, `Category`, `Question`, `Context`).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1fe13352-0183-4f32-b8fd-1c25a919251d",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2 — Log every question as NEW\nEach question row is appended to the Draft Log tab with status `NEW` — the audit trail for this run.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1eb0403c-9984-4221-bf31-f18e5e4b6080",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 — Read knowledge base + loop\nRead Knowledge Base pulls your approved security-policy Google Doc (plain text) → Loop Over Questions processes one question at a time.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d79b7256-f6fb-412f-9fc4-805666b6f418",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4 — AI drafts the answer\nPrepare Question shapes the item → Draft Answer Agent (gpt-4o-mini + Answer Schema Parser) drafts strictly from your knowledge text → row flips to `DRAFTED`.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5f7122ca-533b-4d5d-b2b3-9f0feb129d8e",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1620,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 5 — Confidence gate\nConfidence ≥ threshold → APPROVED. Below threshold → IN_REVIEW + Telegram review request with the draft, confidence, and source.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1120,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "34cc426c-43a3-45b2-8bb3-78e4231ed8d1",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 5",
